# Hover Card

Hover Card previews richer content on pointer hover or keyboard focus. Unlike a tooltip, its content can include interactive links. Keep the trigger focusable and pass the trigger snippet props to it.

Pointer activation dismisses the card and cancels a pending hover before the trigger's click action runs. Focus caused by that pointer press does not open a preview, so quick mouse clicks and touch taps do not flash the card. Keyboard focus still opens it immediately.

Currently available for Svelte only.

